  const platforms={cash:['银行卡','支付宝','微信','家中'],investment:['银行','证券账户','支付宝','基金平台'],item:['家中','保险柜','办公室','其他地点'],debt:['银行','支付宝','京东金融','亲友']};
  const platformIcon=p=>p==='alipay'||p==='支付宝'?'<svg class="platform-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="#1677ff"/><text x="16" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-size="25" font-weight="600" font-family="sans-serif">支</text></svg>':p==='wechat'||p==='微信'||p==='微信余额'?'<svg class="platform-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="#07c160"/><path d="M18 8c-7-3-16 1-13 8 1 2 2 3 4 4l-1 3 4-2 3 1c-3-6 0-10 7-11z" fill="white"/><path d="M21 13c-5 0-9 3-8 7 1 3 4 5 8 5l3-1 3 2-1-3c5-5 1-10-5-10z" fill="white" stroke="#07c160" stroke-width="1"/><g fill="#158747"><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="17" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="1"/><circle cx="24" cy="18" r="1"/></g></svg>':'';
  const chip=(attr,value,label,cls='nature-choice')=>'<button type="button" class="'+cls+'" '+attr+'="'+esc(value)+'" aria-pressed="false">'+label+'</button>';
